# Ask More Photos popup — no free-text textarea
# Source : GJDT-21944_Ask_For_Photos_AI_Products_Testcases | TC_AFP_C10
# Params : ${product_url}
# Map    : data/drafts/popup_no_textarea.map.json  (step -> source row, locator, selector, expected)

open ${product_url}
verify element ask_more_photos_cta is visible
click ask_more_photos_cta
verify element mobile_number_input is visible
take screenshot as c10_01_popup_open
verify element popup_text_area is not present
take screenshot as c10_02_no_textarea_confirmed
